    "message": "In June 2026 the single source project was split into 4 to be as small as possible for clients who wanted a specific set of classes. Creating 4 matching NuGet packages was overkill (no one was using them anyway), so this package is deprecated. If you want to steal or use the classes in this old package then please see the Wiki at https://dev.azure.com/orthogonal/Orthogonal.MixedCommsLib",
